 20
-22.34
 30
0.0
 40
0.5
  1
ENPIRE-T TIP ROWS SHEET, the sheet against the core. Drawn looking from the core toward the object (x = gripper x of the right finger, tip up), so this is its L2 side: mirror it for fab, with L1 as the top layer. L1 = row electrodes (face the Velostat), L2 = leads + tail fingers. 2-layer flex, 12.5 um PI core, 1/3 oz Cu, laser microvias 0.1/0.3 filled+capped, ENIG. Coverlay windows: COVERLAY_OPEN_L1 over the electrodes, COVERLAY_OPEN_L2 over the fingers; stiffener to 0.2 mm on the L1 face, behind the fingers.
